<title>GERMANY: Krupp says dollar correction has ended.</title>
<headline>Krupp says dollar correction has ended.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Hans-Juergen Krupp said on Monday that the dollar level was in a zone where its correction has ended.</p>
<p>&quot;We are in a zone where one can see that the correction has come to an end,&quot; Krupp said.</p>
<p>Krupp declined to say what he believed was an appropriate level for the dollar against the mark.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
